# Generated by Cargo (mirrors src-tauri/.gitignore). climax-core is a path
# dependency / workspace member, so it owns no committed lockfile of its own -
# the lockfile lives with the binary (src-tauri, and the workspace root once 2b
# formalises it). A stray ./target or ./Cargo.lock only appears if cargo is run
# standalone inside this crate; never commit either.
/target/
/Cargo.lock
